/*Finds the monthly benefit and the close date for claims in CLMHDR.
We take the monthly benefit from the Clmhdr file in the following order of preference:
CLAIM_MONTHLY_BENEFIT then POLICY_MONTHLY_BENEFIT then rental.
If the claim is closed, then we take the close date in the following order of preference:
RECLOSE_DATE then CLOSE_DATE.
The RECLOSE_DATE should only be non-null if the claim has been re-opened and closed again, and
so the majority of claims will receive CLOSE_DATE as the close date.*/

Data CLMHDR_&c._Scorecard;
		set CLMHDR_&c._Scorecard;
		if CLAIM_MONTHLY_BENEFIT ne 0 and CLAIM_MONTHLY_BENEFIT ne .
		then	MONTHLY_BENEFIT=CLAIM_MONTHLY_BENEFIT;
		else if POLICY_MONTHLY_BENEFIT ne 0 and POLICY_MONTHLY_BENEFIT ne .
		then	MONTHLY_BENEFIT=POLICY_MONTHLY_BENEFIT;
		else MONTHLY_BENEFIT = RENTAL;
		if RECLOSE_DATE ne .
		then CLOSE_DATE=RECLOSE_DATE;
		else if FIRST_CLOSE_DATE ne .
		then CLOSE_DATE=FIRST_CLOSE_DATE;
		else CLOSE_DATE=.;
		drop CLAIM_MONTHLY_BENEFIT POLICY_MONTHLY_BENEFIT RENTAL;
		FORMAT CLOSE_DATE ddmmyy10.;
run;

